@startuml
title View 3 - Collaboration: operator updates report status (with citizen notification)
actor Operator
participant ReportStatusUpdateGUI as GUI <<Boundary>>
participant SystemServicesController as Fac <<Control>>
participant ReportStatusUpdateController as SC <<Control>>
participant NotificationController as NC <<Control>>
participant UserService as US <<Entity>>
participant ReportService as RS <<Entity>>
participant Report <<Entity>>
participant PersistenceService as PS <<Database>>
database MySQL

Operator -> GUI : choose new status
GUI -> Fac : updateReportStatus(...)
Fac -> SC : registerStatusUpdate(...)
SC -> US : isMunicipalOperator(userId)
SC -> RS : updateReportStatus(...)
RS -> PS : findById(Report)
RS -> Report : assignOperator / updateStatus()
Report -> Report : currentStatus.updateStatus(this)\n(adds StatusUpdate)
RS -> PS : update(report)
PS -> MySQL
SC -> NC : verifyNotifiableStatus / sendNotificationToCitizen
NC -> RS : generateStatusChangeNotification(...)
RS -> PS : save(Notification)
PS -> MySQL
SC --> Fac : result
Fac --> GUI : boolean
GUI --> Operator : feedback
@enduml
